ate":"1","currencyPrice":0.0075,"currencySymbol":"$","isForeignDiscount":null,"ladderLevel":null}],"productImages":["https://assets.lcsc.com/images/lcsc/900x900/20200710_Samsung-Electro-Mechanics-CL10A475KO8NNNC_C19666_front.jpg","https://assets.lcsc.com/images/lcsc/900x900/20200710_Samsung-Electro-Mechanics-CL10A475KO8NNNC_C19666_back.jpg","https://assets.lcsc.com/images/lcsc/900x900/20200710_Samsung-Electro-Mechanics-CL10A475KO8NNNC_C19666_blank.jpg"],"edaSvgInfo":{"schSvg":"//image.easyeda.com/component_svgs/prod/3d1896a2a86cb913354614695da7415b.svg?t=1739501688","pcbSvg":"//image.easyeda.com/component_svgs/prod/f8151fdc728a41ebbc304e11d39e5437.svg?t=1739501688"},"faqs":[{"question":"What are the primary electrical specifications of the Samsung Electro-Mechanics CL10A475KO8NNNC?","answer":"The Samsung Electro-Mechanics CL10A475KO8NNNC is a multilayer ceramic capacitor (MLCC) with a nominal capacitance of 4.7µF and a 16V DC rated voltage. It uses an X5R dielectric, which is specified to maintain capacitance variation within ±15% over the operating temperature range of -55°C to +85°C. The capacitor is supplied in a 0603 (1608 metric) surface-mount package measuring approximately 1.6mm × 0.8mm."},{"question":"Where is the CL10A475KO8NNNC typically used?","answer":"According to the Samsung Electro-Mechanics catalog, MLCCs in this product family are used in applications such as desktop PCs, notebook PCs, handheld products (HHP), digital still cameras (DSC), digital video cameras (DVC), LCD TVs, memory modules, PDAs, game machines, and DC-DC converters. The CL10A475KO8NNNC should be selected based on its 4.7µF capacitance, 16V DC rated voltage, X5R dielectric, and 0603 (1608 metric) package to ensure it meets the electrical and environmental requirements of the intended application."},{"question":"What temperature characteristics does the CL10A475KO8NNNC provide?","answer":"The CL10A475KO8NNNC uses an X5R dielectric, which is specified to maintain capacitance variation within ±15% across the rated operating temperature range of -55°C to +85°C. Designers should verify that these characteristics meet the requirements of their intended application."},{"question":"Is the CL10A475KO8NNNC compatible with standard surface-mount assembly?","answer":"Yes. The CL10A475KO8NNNC is supplied in a 0603 (1608 metric) surface-mount package and is provided in tape-and-reel packaging for automated surface-mount assembly. Samsung also includes an Application Manual for Surface Mounting in the product catalog for assembly guidance."},{"question":"Why is the CL10A475KO8NNNC a good choice for compact electronic designs?","answer":"The CL10A475KO8NNNC combines a 4.7µF capacitance, 16V DC rated voltage, X5R dielectric, and a compact 0603 (1608 metric) package. These characteristics make it suitable for designs that require a small surface-mount ceramic capacitor while meeting the specified electrical and environmental ratings."}],"pdfUrl":"https://datasheet.lcsc.com/datasheet/pdf/02336ea48ea44ca18c72517dd3cb7b47.pdf?productCode=C19666","authenticationList":["ROHS3 认证"],"isRohsCert":true,"rohsCertType":"ROHS3","rohsCertList":[{"fileCode":"wj1864931","fileName":" 贴片电容(MLCC)_ROHS认证_SAMSUNG(三星).zip","url":"https://datasheet.lcsc.com/certification/rohs/fe72c154ab3703f908ae5b1ac157c1ec.zip"},{"fileCode":"wj1624669","fileName":"ROHS认证_贴片电容原材料_SAMSUNG(三星).zip","url":"https://datasheet.lcsc.com/certification/rohs/329ecc8904689d9af5b272ec0ed8e00a.zip"},{"fileCode":"wj1750838","fileName":"全量通用_ROHS认证_SAMSUNG(三星半导体).pdf","url":"https://datasheet.lcsc.com/certification/rohs/fe7ad62d96832adf9770d718059cff38.pdf"},{"fileCode":"wj1478399","fileName":"MLCCCL系列_ROHS认证(英文版)_SAMSUNG(三星).pdf","url":"https://datasheet.lcsc.com/certification/rohs/5b97a5d84519001adb216d4c9e6919ce.pdf"}],"productDescEn":"4.7uF ±10% 16V Ceramic Capacitor X5R 0603","productIntroEn":"4.7uF ±10% 16V Ceramic Capacitor X5R 0603","paramVOList":[{"paramCode":"param_10951_n","paramName":"容值","paramNameEn